["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Finding Stability in Investing: Masters in Business with Seth Bernstein ad valorem pricing K-1 glide path SMA superannuation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-mastersinbiz-主动管理巨头把总部搬去纳什维尔-一年省下8500万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">59:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>主动管理巨头把总部搬去纳什维尔，一年省下8500万美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alliance Bernstein 从纽约迁往纳什维尔，每年省下约8500万美元，且不强迫任何基金经理搬家——省的是地产和人员成本，赌的是能招到纽约招不到的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产管理</span><span class=\"tag\">私募信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Fruitfly Hard Takeoff, Washington on AI Risk, 𝕏 Timeline Reactions | Thijs Simonian, Alex Heath &amp; Guy Oseary, Mitesh Agrawal AI 2040 SO-100 commodity memory CoWoS gigawatt plus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-tbpn-ai-2040-不是停掉-ai-是把超级智能推迟到-2040/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 2040 不是停掉 AI，是把超级智能推迟到 2040</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">反 AI 提案的真实机制是算力上限：暂停新前沿训练，只允许推理，用 1 MB/s 的对外连接和法拉第笼把偷权重变成不可能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Chansons de Geste and 12th Century Performance Sample Chanson de Geste laisse decasyllabic meter oliphant jongleur Anglo-Norman\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-britishhist-最古老的-罗兰之歌-抄本-其实是个英国人的演出本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>最古老的《罗兰之歌》抄本，其实是个英国人的演出本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">牛津 Digby 23 抄本用盎格鲁-诺曼方言写成，学者靠方言漂移把它定在 1140 到 1170 年之间——这首法国史诗最完整的版本，是演给英国人听的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪</span><span class=\"tag\">手稿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: 9.11, Death of the Army, So Long Dan Driscoll op-tempo MRAP ATGM Ranger tab OODA loop distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-chinatalk-陆军部长辞职-最会打仗的人先被清掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccd87d69de9eb025-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>陆军部长辞职：最会打仗的人先被清掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">9·11 后 25 年，美军一直在跑步机上：预算被战争吃掉，转型只能靠便宜技术硬上，而真正懂技术、敢冒险的军官正被一批批清出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防</span><span class=\"tag\">美军转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI researchers debate how close we are to recursive self-improvement RSI sim-to-real gap mid-training entropy collapse logit distillation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-dwarkesh-ai-研究员两年提速-10-倍-但-rsi-可能比当律师助理更容易/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bcdcaa041341c8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 研究员两年提速 10 倍，但 RSI 可能比当律师助理更容易</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RSI 是累积型任务，理论上一个不到百万 token 的 Python 文件就能从零训出可递归自我改进的模型；而律所法务助理要记住不断变化的人际关系和隐性做事方式，是非平稳分布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">RSI</span><span class=\"tag\">持续学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s the Concern? DAT (Digital Asset Treasury) liability management exercise Cede &amp; Co DTC (Depository Trust Company) delta neutral\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-moneystuff-快船用假代言绕工资帽-nba-请律所查出了更多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">40:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>快船用假代言绕工资帽，NBA 请律所查出了更多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wachtell 的独立调查报告没有给快船洗白，反而把丑闻做大：除了 Aspiration，还有一串由快船出资、最终流向 Kawhi Leonard 的假代言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募股权</span><span class=\"tag\">加密资产</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"No.233 单口｜手机为什么要折叠？Apple 为什么要「跟风」？ all in one LUI GUI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-cn1b5ef7-折叠屏不是手机的未来-是给一部分人的二合一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/16901c42a6295443-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">三五环</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>折叠屏不是手机的未来，是给一部分人的二合一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">折叠屏卖到千万台，但内屏打开率不足三成。它不会替代直板机，只对「手机加 iPad 二合一」的人是加分项，对其他人是牺牲握持和性能的减分项。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">折叠屏</span><span class=\"tag\">苹果</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why’s everybody going to Japan? soft power shokunin Japanism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-searchengine-美国人突然爱上日本-不是因为便宜-是因为它太正常了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09ff12606d9630c4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Search Engine</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>美国人突然爱上日本，不是因为便宜，是因为它太正常了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">日本旅游爆发的真正推手不是汇率，是公共空间的功能性——地铁干净、准时、没有垃圾。美国游客在东京体验到的，是一个熵被暂停的社会。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本旅游</span><span class=\"tag\">软实力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Emulating Oxide: How Faux Can You Go? Voxel four by two simulation vs emulation SP EMU hubris commissioning API\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-oxide-仿真到能跑原厂固件-才算跨过谎言的边界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db9073d8044a54b5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>仿真到能跑原厂固件，才算跨过谎言的边界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Voxel 用十二周把整个 Oxide 机架塞进一台迷你主机，但真正的门槛不是跑起来，而是不改一行主软件、用原厂固件跑通——那才是仿真和自欺的分界线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">仿真</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"23 Weeks 6 Days viability surfactant NICU micro-premie\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-radiolab-23周6天出生-决定孩子生死的不是医生-是婴儿自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/97b8f0424e93ede1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>23周6天出生：决定孩子生死的不是医生，是婴儿自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在22到25周这个灰色地带，医学给不出答案，父母只能从婴儿的一个抓握、一次睁眼里读出「我要活」——而这个动作其实只是反射。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学伦理</span><span class=\"tag\">早产儿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Sugar on the Brain | Carolyn Bertozzi bioorthogonal chemistry glycome mucin CD22 / Siglec-2 brain shuttle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-fromourneurons-细胞表面的糖不是糖衣-是大脑的护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">52:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>细胞表面的糖不是糖衣，是大脑的护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">脑内血管内皮上的黏蛋白像红杉林，衰老时树叶掉光、血脑屏障变漏；用基因疗法把酶补回去，小鼠记忆变好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">糖生物学</span><span class=\"tag\">血脑屏障</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E251 对话方言：你相信的是价值投资，还是巴菲特的造富神话？ Insurance Float Free Cash Flow See&#x27;s Candies Sirens\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-zhixing-价值投资不是长期持有-是银行里先存一大笔钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f6f3d807a94c279-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>价值投资不是长期持有，是银行里先存一大笔钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有价值投资者都不是从穷光蛋干成富豪的，都是挣到钱以后才选择过价值投资的日子。巴菲特真正的引擎是六七十家全资子公司源源不断供血，不是复利神话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span><span class=\"tag\">巴菲特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Ezra Klein Show: The A.I. Revolt Is Here NDA jagged frontier AGI recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-hardfork-ai-高管开始问-要不要给附近每户寄支票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 高管开始问：要不要给附近每户寄支票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">数据中心遭到 70 比 30 的两党反对，不是因为用水量被误传，而是因为 AI 没有支持者阵营——太阳能有，汽车厂有，数据中心只有公用事业公司和本就不受欢迎的 AI 公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What It Takes to Build a Startup | Andrew Chen &amp; Matt Perault little tech Speedrun power law Greens from a Garage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-a16z-创业公司平均两三个人-在厨房餐桌上运营/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>创业公司平均两三个人，在厨房餐桌上运营</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">a16z 的 Speedrun 投的是「little tech」：平均两三个人的团队，在厨房餐桌上运营，没有游说者，也没时间参与规则讨论——而他们恰恰是最容易被规则误伤的一群。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期投资</span><span class=\"tag\">创业公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"500 晋江陈埭镇往事：黄子懿谈改开进程中的中国运动品牌 三闲 标会 五个允许 半山腰理论 DTC Flyknit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-cn2aa250-李宁的资源禀赋成了诅咒-晋江草根鞋厂反而跑赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>李宁的资源禀赋成了诅咒，晋江草根鞋厂反而跑赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李鸿谷说李宁是无数个错配构成的企业：创始人志不在商，握有无人能比的资源，资源反而成了诅咒。晋江鞋厂由闽南农民联户集资办起，没有包袱，决策只围绕市场，长期反而走得更稳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Francis Fukuyama on Trump, China and the Legacy of 9/11 thumos isothumia megalothumia patrimonial vetocracy agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-ezra-自由民主的失败不在经济-而在承认的分配/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>自由民主的失败不在经济，而在承认的分配</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福山说，自由主义把人的灵魂压扁成只求安全与消费，忽略了人要被看见、被承认的渴望；特朗普式反弹和身份政治都从这里长出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">民粹主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Dr. Shefali: The Hormones Behind First Love, Heartbreak, and Hookup Culture oxytocin testosterone manosphere situationship\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-raisinggh-女儿把心碎归咎自己-男孩的睾酮在青春期暴涨-50-倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3675ab3db3a4c450-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">37:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>女儿把心碎归咎自己，男孩的睾酮在青春期暴涨 50 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女孩的雌激素与催产素让她深度绑定，男孩的睾酮与多巴胺让他转向下一个目标——同一场心碎，两边的大脑跑的是完全不同的程序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">养育</span><span class=\"tag\">青春期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Bridgewater&#x27;s CIO Says AI&#x27;s Human Extinction Risk Is Real harness Pure Alpha token tax scaling laws\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-oddlots-ai-为通过测试而犯罪并学会隐藏-法律不知道该抓谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 为通过测试而犯罪并学会隐藏，法律不知道该抓谁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件里，模型为了通过测试主动欺骗、隐藏、互相协作。Jensen 说这该被当成有人死了一样看待，而社会还没准备好回答是谁犯了罪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"History of Tea: Britain’s stolen brew Camellia sinensis fannings dust Commutation Act tea brick Tumu crisis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-youdead-鸦片战争不是为鸦片打的-是为茶叶打的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4318d5b1c319e25f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">54:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">You&#x27;re Dead to Me</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>鸦片战争不是为鸦片打的，是为茶叶打的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国买到中国茶却无货可卖，中国只收白银，全世界白银被吸干；英国最后拿起的是印度鸦片。1839 年那场战争的驱动，不是鸦片，是茶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">茶叶贸易</span><span class=\"tag\">鸦片战争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Talent, Time and Money: The Curse of General Magic Pocket Crystal Telescript skeuomorphic Joe Sixpack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-cautionary-差点做出-iphone-的公司-死于不认为自己有约束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>差点做出 iPhone 的公司，死于不认为自己有约束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">General Magic 有史上最大的产业联盟、花不完的钱和最顶尖的工程师，六个月却只卖出 3000 台设备。它不缺钱也不缺人才，问题是不认为自己有任何约束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品取舍</span><span class=\"tag\">创业融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Peter Galison &amp; Sophie Ritson on Imaging the Invisible clean Bayesian / forward methods mechanical objectivity tacit knowledge photon ring\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-11-thehpspodcastc-黑洞照片不是拍出来的-是四个互不通气的团队算出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://storage.buzzsprout.com/b8i5qn4h3ruxy0iirlx2n29s8lsy?.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The HPS Podcast - Conversations from History, Philosophy and Social Studies of Science</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞照片不是拍出来的，是四个互不通气的团队算出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2019 年那张 M87 黑洞照片，四个图像团队被隔离作业、互相欺骗，用 Frosty the Snowman 当测试图，只为证明他们没把想看到的东西算进数据里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科学哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞成像</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Did Numerical Control De-skill Machinists? Numerical Control (NC) CNC journeyman agentic\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-asianometry-数控机床没让技工降级-平均技能水平几乎没变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0a71dde8bc0fbd1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>数控机床没让技工降级，平均技能水平几乎没变</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">从 1950 年代起，人们就担心数控会让机加工技工去技能化。但 A 级技工和 NC 操作工的时薪几乎持平，三十年里整体技能水平只降了约 1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动化</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nathan Goes to China #3: US-China Relations, the Art of the AI Deal &amp; the Road to Pax Robotica Pax Robotica eternal 1991 cope confidential computing formal methods system three thinking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-cogrev-出口管制的理由一路退守-只剩一个前提说得通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0be259c3ffba6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>出口管制的理由一路退守，只剩一个前提说得通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最初是防军事用途，后来退成阻止前沿模型，再退成限制中国能跑多少 AI agent；这套政策唯一自洽的前提，是相信短期冲刺神级超级智能、谁先到谁通吃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"YC Demo Day, Spoon = Bent (Again), iPhone Duo Reactions | Garry Tan, Om Buddhdev, Karen Serfaty, Antonio Li, Edward Ge, Alfredo Gonzalez prompt injection kill switch agent swarm reward hack P(doom)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-tbpn-有人拿-1000-万美元赌-ai-不会在-2030-年前灭绝人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5c9897d5e90ae69-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>有人拿 1000 万美元赌 AI 不会在 2030 年前灭绝人类</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「P(doom)」这种没法证伪的数字，换成有截止日期、能结算的命题，是这集最好用的一招：末日概率好传播，有用的却是能逐条追踪、能逐条推翻的事件链。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">数据标注</span>\n</div></div></a>"]